rows.en:
C-could this be...?
...But why would it be here?
My heart pounding, I crept up to the thing and worked up the nerve to call out to it.{p}

Oh, I see...
You don't know.
Then I'll tell you.{p}

...Oops, you're different, {a}.
You're not like the boys in my class.
I feel like you'd be at least a little dependable.{p}

I see.
Same as me, then.
I couldn't take either side either.{p}

I mean, thinking about it now, maybe the person I saw wasn't the thief after all.
Nobody reported anything stolen that time, you know.
Maybe it was just someone from our class who came back for something they forgot...{p}

I see...
I'm a little surprised you'd answer like that, {a}.
...Not that it means much.{p}

I couldn't move a single step.
It all really happened in an instant.
With the rift gone, the classroom didn't look the least bit different from usual.{p}
